:name: STM32F4 Discovery
:description: Boots the flight controller firmware on a simulated STM32F4DISCOVERY.

# Run from the repo root. Pass another ELF with `$bin = @path` before including.
$bin ?= @firmware/target/thumbv7em-none-eabihf/release/firmware

using sysbus
mach create "blackbox"

# Renode's own description of the board: the STM32F407VG and the parts around
# it, including the green LED on PD12.
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery-kit.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

# Log each time the green LED changes state.
logLevel -1 gpioPortD.UserLED

start
